<back><div type="verses">
<lg label="2."><l>Rejoice in the Lord! Rejoice in the Lord!</l><l>Rejoice in His life; rejoice in His Word.</l><l>Rejoice in His love for you all your days.</l><l>Rejoice in the Lord always!</l></lg>
</div>
</back>
